[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRYSTAL_WAR]
War of Eternity

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRYSTAL_WAR_desc]
§g“With terror he judges and wages war. His eyes are like blazing fire, and on his head are many crowns.”§!\nNow that Sombra is back to power, and the Crystal Empire has restored its independence and glory, it the war finally over? No, it is just the beginning.\nThere are still a lot of places that still don’t tremble when they heard the name of Sombra, and there are still a lot of ponies who do not understand the beauty of fear.\nThere are still a lot of lost creatures who need their salvation, and there are still a lot of wandering umbrums who need their bellies filled.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRYSTAL_WAR]
永恒的战争

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_CRYSTAL_WAR_desc]
§g“在恐惧中审判，以恐惧战争。他的眼睛如同烈火，头上戴着许多冠冕。”§!\n如今森布拉重掌大权，水晶帝国恢复了独立与荣耀，战争终于结束了吗？不，这才刚刚开始。\n依然有很多地方听到森布拉的名字不会感到颤抖，依然有很多小马不明白恐惧的美丽。\n依然有很多迷失的生物需要他们的救赎，依然有很多徘徊的暗影需要他们的肚子填满。

